      "target_id": "XML:1802668"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25465-zh-00038",
      "text": "2. 说明符合《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第四十九条第一款任一项规定的",
      "source_hash": "5dea7aedb2c69f7129bc08a4a493bc8ddcdda37f7045e01fe9e754139c11868a",
      "target_id": "XML:1802669"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25465-zh-00039",
      "text": "资料",
      "source_hash": "f881c152f17ab3ccdcb90fd03fa53e782aee21de183e346633e89fe139645309",
      "target_id": "XML:1802670"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25465-zh-00040",
      "text": "3. 依据《智慧城市建设及产业振兴等相关法律》第四十九条第二款后段，管辖地方自治团体负责人的意见及措施要求",
      "source_hash": "e4fc6a62f67b1bc64a0a445e4a633f8b9b845d743a69b705d7ef1a416fe2b25a",
      "target_id": "XML:1802671"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25465-zh-00041",
      "text": "以及相应的措施计划",
      "source_hash": "85852e97e1c34330fc7442490d742a996ef2a49833c2739b53fb0ce78c299d94",
      "target_id": "XML:1802672"
    },
    {
      "id": "A25465-zh-00042",
